@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="content-medium">
<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p class="text-muted">
        This Student Management System is a demonstration project created
        for educational and portfolio purposes.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h4>Information Stored</h4>
    <p>
        The application may store information entered by users, such as
        student names, email addresses, phone numbers, courses, enrollments,
        and grades.
    </p>

    <h4>How Information Is Used</h4>
    <p>
        The information is used only to demonstrate the functionality of
        the Student Management System, including managing students, courses,
        enrollments, and grades.
    </p>

    <h4>Data Sharing</h4>
    <p>
        This application does not intentionally share stored information
        with third-party services.
    </p>

    <h4>Demo Data</h4>
    <p>
        Users should not enter real or sensitive personal information into
        this demonstration application.
    </p>

    <h4>Project Purpose</h4>
    <p>
        This project is intended for software development practice and
        portfolio demonstration and is not currently designed for production use.
    </p>
</div>
</div>